<p>When a hallucination from Hideous Visions is slain, it unleashes a psychic shriek dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">35, 47, 56, 64, 71</acronym> darkness damage to enemies in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym></p>